Subject: [PATCH] lineage: Pong as the default notification sound

Pong instead of Argon as the default notification sound.

Done as a patch and not as a property, which is the whole point of this file:
vendor/lineage sets ro.config.notification_sound in PRODUCT_PRODUCT_PROPERTIES,
and setting the same name again from vendor/extra/product.mk is a DUPLICATE
sysprop assignment in the same partition. post_process_props.py rejects that and
the build dies. ro.* immutability -- first value wins -- is a RUNTIME property and
never gets a chance to apply, which is the trap: the option looks correct and
fails at build time.

So change the value at its one source instead.

---
--- a/config/common_mobile.mk
+++ b/config/common_mobile.mk
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@
 
 # Default notification/alarm sounds
 PRODUCT_PRODUCT_PROPERTIES += \
-    ro.config.notification_sound=Argon.ogg \
+    ro.config.notification_sound=Pong.ogg \
     ro.config.alarm_alert=Hassium.ogg
 
 # Apps
